Environment Variables:

  PALADIN_CONFIG
      Configuration file path
      Default: config.yml

  PALADIN_LOG_LEVEL
      Logging level
      Default: info

  OPENAI_API_KEY
      OpenAI API key
      Default: (required)

  REDIS_URL
      Redis connection URL
      Default: redis://localhost:6379

  NO_COLOR
      Disable colored output
      Default: 0
